#: docs/design/usb-device.md:1
msgid "USB FS device 包所有权与接入边界"
msgstr "USB FS device packet ownership and integration boundaries"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:3
msgid ""
"公共接口是 `nexus/io/usb_device.h`。生产实现归属 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`， 当前精确适配 "
"STM32F407VET6／ZGT6 的 internal-PHY full-speed device PIO。 目录按 STM32F4 "
"家族组织，不表示该系列全部器件已完成接入。Native 位于 `tests/support/native/`，仅作为显式启用的主机测试模型。维护范围是 "
"EP0 control、显式选择的 EP1–EP3 bulk IN/OUT 与 interrupt IN、 "
"SETUP/reset/suspend/resume 事实、STALL、SET_ADDRESS、取消与退出。 DCD 的一次 request "
"仍是一个不超过 MPS 的包；非零 endpoint 的 active／mask 由 独立可选 activation face "
"显式控制。SET_CONFIGURATION、配置就绪及其回滚由外部 Chapter 9 owner 负责，packet 机制不能单独证明完整枚举／物理 "
"reset 恢复。 可选 `Nexus::USBControl` 组合 EP0 多包 DATA、必要 ZLP 与 STATUS；独立的 "
"`Nexus::USBDescriptors` 校验外部描述符结构。两者不创建任务或分配内存。 具体 class "
"分派、描述符字节与查找、VID/PID、字符串、配置及恢复策略由外部工程提供。 可选 `Nexus::USBACM` 只组合下述 CDC ACM "
"控制子集；没有数据泵或完整 CDC/HID 类栈， 也不增加 Host、HS、DMA、ISO 或 remote wake 支持。"
msgstr ""
"The public interface is `nexus/io/usb_device.h`. Production implementation "
"belongs to `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`, currently adapting internal-PHY full-speed "
"device PIO for the exact STM32F407VET6/ZGT6 parts. Organizing directories by "
"STM32F4 family does not mean every device in that series is integrated. "
"Native resides in `tests/support/native/` solely as an explicitly enabled "
"host-test model. Maintained scope covers EP0 control, explicitly selected "
"EP1–EP3 bulk IN/OUT and interrupt IN, SETUP/reset/suspend/resume facts, "
"STALL, SET_ADDRESS, cancellation and shutdown. One DCD request remains one "
"packet no larger than MPS. A separate optional activation face explicitly "
"controls nonzero endpoint active/mask state. An external Chapter 9 owner "
"handles SET_CONFIGURATION, configuration readiness and rollback. Packet "
"mechanisms alone cannot prove complete enumeration or physical-reset "
"recovery. Optional `Nexus::USBControl` composes EP0 multipacket DATA, "
"required ZLP and STATUS; separate `Nexus::USBDescriptors` checks external "
"descriptor structure. Neither creates tasks nor allocates memory. External "
"projects supply concrete class dispatch, descriptor bytes/lookup, VID/PID, "
"strings, configuration and recovery policy. Optional `Nexus::USBACM` composes"
" only the CDC ACM control subset described below; it supplies no data pump or"
" complete CDC/HID class stack, and adds no Host, HS, DMA, ISO or remote wake "
"support."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:18
msgid "对象、资源与时钟"
msgstr "Objects, resources and clocks"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:20
msgid ""
"controller 和 endpoint 保持独立 identity；公共 face 只有 readonly ops 与 context。 装配拥有一个"
" controller、精确 endpoint 数组、精确事件环和一个显式 48 MHz clock owner。实例共享只读方法表，没有全局可变 "
"registry、endpoint 最大池、隐藏 worker 或必选 OS。未选实例不产生状态，MCU 热路径用 direct volatile "
"MMIO。模型编译只 替换外部 MMIO/NVIC 叶端口，MCU 不携带模型函数表或运行时模拟分支。"
msgstr ""
"Controller and endpoint retain separate identities; public faces contain only"
" read-only ops and context. Assembly owns one controller, exact endpoint "
"array, exact event ring and an explicit 48 MHz clock owner. Instances share "
"read-only tables without global mutable registries, maximum endpoint pools, "
"hidden workers or mandatory OS. Unselected instances create no state, and MCU"
" hot paths use direct volatile MMIO. Model builds replace only external "
"MMIO/NVIC leaves; MCUs carry no model-function tables or runtime-simulation "
"branches."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:26
msgid ""
"STM32F407 的 OTG_FS 基址是 `0x50000000`，四个 IN / 四个 OUT 方向、320-word FIFO， 单一 IRQ "
"67；绑定用锁定 SDK 验证实际 offset、stride、容量和 W1C/只读位。 EP0 固定 64-byte MPS；bulk MPS 只能是 "
"8/16/32/64。interrupt 仅选入 EP1–EP3 IN，MPS 为 1–64 B，允许 10 B 等非二次幂长度；interrupt "
"OUT 和 ISO 未接入。 RX FIFO 至少 64 words；每个被选 IN FIFO 至少 16 words，分区先验证无重叠且总计 不超过 "
"320 words。方向、类型、MPS、FIFO 与重复 identity 的非法计划在 clock validate／retain 和 MMIO "
"之前拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"STM32F407 OTG_FS has base address `0x50000000`, four IN/four OUT directions, "
"a 320-word FIFO and one IRQ 67. The binding validates actual offsets, "
"strides, capacities and W1C/readonly bits against the locked SDK. EP0 has "
"fixed 64-byte MPS; bulk MPS is limited to 8/16/32/64. Interrupt selects only "
"EP1–EP3 IN, with MPS 1–64 B, permitting non-power-of-two lengths such as 10 "
"B. Interrupt OUT and ISO are not integrated. RX FIFO requires at least 64 "
"words; each selected IN FIFO requires at least 16 words. Partition validation"
" rejects overlap and totals above 320 words. Invalid direction, type, MPS, "
"FIFO or duplicate identity plans reject before clock validate/retain and "
"MMIO."

