msgid "实际 48 MHz 来源"
msgstr "Actual 48 MHz source"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "接入行为"
msgstr "Integration behavior"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "STM32F407"
msgstr "STM32F407"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "HSE 8 MHz / M8 × N336 / Q7"
msgstr "HSE 8 MHz / M8 × N336 / Q7"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "验证现有 PLL/ready，只管理 USBFS gate"
msgstr "Validate existing PLL/ready; manage only the USBFS gate"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:38
msgid ""
"clock owner 管理精确 consumer count；失败回滚缺少读回证明时仍保留清理责任。 DCD 先 "
"validate/retain，退出完成后 release consumer，最后由外部 owner stop "
"时钟。pin/electrical/VBUS 和所有共享时钟消费者必须由外部资源 owner 先授权并 静止，不能仅凭 gate "
"为零推断系统独占。其他晶振或 PLL 配置需要独立时钟合同， 不能凭声明 `48 MHz` 直接复用当前配置。"
msgstr ""
"The clock owner manages the exact consumer count. Failed rollback retains "
"cleanup responsibility when readback proof is missing. DCD validates/retains "
"first and releases its consumer after shutdown completes; the external owner "
"stops the clock last. The external resource owner must first authorize "
"pins/electrical/VBUS and quiesce all shared clock consumers. A zero gate "
"alone does not imply system exclusivity. Other oscillator or PLL "
"configurations require independent clock contracts; declaring `48 MHz` does "
"not authorize reusing the current configuration."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:44
msgid ""
"controller、endpoint、事件环与 request 按所选实例静态分配；可选 ROM profile、 EP0 adapter 和 "
"outer request 分别计入其 owner 的资源预算。私有 endpoint 的 `uint8_t transfer` 只保存类型，不增加 "
"interval、调度或队列字段。结构尺寸、 未选 section GC 与完整 Flash／RAM 成本须由同源配置的 ARM ELF／map 建立， "
"不以 host sizeof 或旧版本 probe 代替当前镜像测量。"
msgstr ""
"Controllers, endpoints, event rings and requests are statically allocated for"
" selected instances. Optional ROM profiles, EP0 adapters and outer requests "
"count separately toward their owners' resource budgets. Private endpoint "
"`uint8_t transfer` stores only the type and adds no interval, scheduling or "
"queue fields. Structure sizes, unselected-section GC and complete Flash/RAM "
"cost require ARM ELF/map evidence from the same source and configuration; "
"host sizeof or old probes cannot replace current-image measurement."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:50
msgid "选定 ROM profile 与描述符"
msgstr "Selected ROM profile and descriptors"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:52
msgid ""
"`nexus/io/usb_profile.h` 的只读 profile 绑定既有 controller／endpoint face，以及 "
"选定的方向、类型、MPS、FIFO、48 MHz、internal PHY、FS device 与 PIO 事实。 只有 USB 被选入且 "
"`factory.capabilities = true` 时，生成器才产生 profile、精确 endpoint 数组与 "
"`nx_factory_usb_profile` getter。设为 `false` 时不生成这些对象 或 getter；普通 USB "
"face、方法表、provider context 与既有 generic capability 类型不因此扩大。getter 不初始化硬件，也不发现新 "
"endpoint。 装配在既有 `transfer` 字段增加 `\"interrupt\"` 取值；不可变 IR 与公共 profile 字段不变。 "
"公共 `NX_USB_PROFILE_INTERRUPT` 的枚举值是 2，USB wire／寄存器 EPTYP 值是 3； provider "
"显式映射类型，不把两者直接强转混用。"
msgstr ""
"The read-only profile in `nexus/io/usb_profile.h` binds existing "
"controller/endpoint faces and the selected direction, type, MPS, FIFO, 48 "
"MHz, internal PHY, FS device and PIO facts. The generator emits the profile, "
"exact endpoint array and `nx_factory_usb_profile` getter only when USB is "
"selected and `factory.capabilities = true`. With `false`, it emits none of "
"these objects or the getter; ordinary USB faces, method tables, provider "
"contexts and existing generic capability types do not grow as a result. The "
"getter neither initializes hardware nor discovers new endpoints. Assembly "
"adds the value `\"interrupt\"` to the existing `transfer` field; immutable IR"
" and public profile fields remain unchanged. Public "
"`NX_USB_PROFILE_INTERRUPT` has enum value 2, whereas USB wire/register EPTYP "
"is 3. The provider explicitly maps the types rather than casting between "
"them."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:62
msgid ""
"`nx_usb_profile_validate` 只读检查选定事实，不能证明实际时钟、PCB、VBUS 或枚举。 外部 descriptor 通过 "
"`nx_usb_descriptor_view_t` 传给 "
"`nx_usb_descriptor_validate`：device、configuration、string 必须完整；校验 "
"length／total、EP0 MPS、唯一 interface、alternate 0，以及 bulk／interrupt IN endpoint "
"的方向／编号／类型／MPS 与选定 profile 的对应关系。interrupt 描述符的 `bInterval` 必须是 1–255 个 full-"
"speed 1 ms frame 的线性计数，零无效；它由外部 描述符独占，不复制到 TOML、IR、profile 或 provider "
"state。DCD 不调度 host poll， 也不承诺实际间隔；bulk 的既有 interval 处理保持不变。选定类型不符、描述的 "
"endpoint 未选入 profile 或 MPS 不符返回 INVALID；interrupt OUT、ISO、非零 control 与 "
"alternate setting 仍为 UNSUPPORTED，保留字段非法仍为 INVALID。class-specific 子结构只检查边界， "
"不解码其类语义。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_usb_profile_validate` checks selected facts read-only; it cannot prove "
"actual clocks, PCB, VBUS or enumeration. External descriptors reach "
"`nx_usb_descriptor_validate` through `nx_usb_descriptor_view_t`: device, "
"configuration and string views must be complete. Validation checks "
"lengths/totals, EP0 MPS, unique interfaces, alternate zero, and the "
"correspondence of bulk/interrupt IN endpoint direction, number, type and MPS "
"with the selected profile. An interrupt descriptor's `bInterval` must be a "
"linear count of 1–255 full-speed 1 ms frames; zero is invalid. External "
"descriptor bytes alone own it: it is not copied into TOML, IR, profiles or "
"provider state. DCD neither schedules host polls nor promises actual "
"intervals; existing bulk interval handling remains unchanged. A selected-type"
" mismatch, a described endpoint absent from the selected profile or an MPS "
"mismatch returns INVALID. Interrupt OUT, ISO, nonzero control and alternate "
"settings remain UNSUPPORTED; invalid reserved fields remain INVALID. Class-"
"specific subordinate records are bounds-checked without decoding class "
"semantics."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:74
msgid ""
"描述符校验按给定完整长度扫描，不读取硬件、不复制或保留 descriptor；通过只表示 结构合法。选择哪段描述符、处理何种请求及 class "
"内容仍属外部策略。发送后， descriptor／reply 字节必须保持有效且不变，直到 outer request 的 acquire "
"SETTLED。"
msgstr ""
"Descriptor validation scans the full supplied length without reading "
"hardware, copying descriptors or retaining them; passing establishes "
"structural validity only. Descriptor selection, request handling and class "
"content remain external policy. Once sent, descriptor/reply bytes must remain"
" valid and unchanged until the outer request's SETTLED is observed with "
"acquire semantics."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:78
msgid ""
"profile、endpoint 数组、face／ops、adapter、request 和 view／snapshot 元数据 须按其 C "
"类型自然对齐，地址范围不能回绕；非法对齐在 typed 访问前拒绝。 descriptor bytes 只需 byte "
"alignment。数值检查不证明任意地址或 opaque 私有 context 可访问；调用者仍须提供合法且保持有效的可读／可写存储。"
msgstr ""
"The profile, endpoint array, face/ops, adapter, request and view/snapshot "
"metadata must have the natural alignment of their C types, and address ranges"
" must not wrap; invalid alignment is rejected before typed access. Descriptor"
" bytes require only byte alignment. Numeric checks do not establish "
"accessibility of arbitrary addresses or opaque private contexts; callers must"
" still supply valid readable/writable storage and keep it valid."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:83
msgid "包完成与控制 epoch"
msgstr "Packet completion and control epochs"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:85
msgid ""
"prepare 不访问 payload；拒绝 admission 不保留新引用。ACCEPTED 借用 request 与 payload，直到 "
"acquire-observed SETTLED。所有 request、payload、输出、count、 immutable clock ops 和 "
"wake target 均检查与 controller/endpoint/ring/clock state 及已有 loan 的重叠。拒绝 "
"state/read_events 输出别名时输出保持原值。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare never accesses payloads; rejected admission retains no new "
"references. ACCEPTED borrows requests and payloads until acquire-observed "
"SETTLED. Requests, payloads, outputs, counts, immutable clock ops and wake "
"targets are checked against controller/endpoint/ring/clock state and existing"
" loans for overlap. Rejected state/read_events output aliases preserve "
"outputs."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:90
msgid ""
"IN 的每次有限 data／ZLP 的长度寄存器写入 `(1U << 19) | length`（PKTCNT=1）， "
"MCNT／保留高位保持零，interrupt 不增加 odd/even-frame 命令。 每个选定 IN direction 使用独立 Tx FIFO，"
" 一次同步装入整个不超过 64 B 的包，没有剩余软件 refill 工作；TX-empty mask 保持零， 不创建 TXFE refill "
"worker。IN FIFO 写入不是完成，只有 XFRC、EP enable 已清、 FIFO 空闲容量恢复并且观察到的 W1C completion "
"清除读回成功才发布 SUCCESS。 OUT 必须同时读到包数据和 XFRC， short packet 正常完成；越界包的所有 FIFO words "
"都被消费，最多复制 caller capacity， 之后报告 OVERFLOW 并排空，不越界写 caller buffer。"
msgstr ""
"Each finite IN data/ZLP writes `(1U << 19) | length` to the length register "
"(PKTCNT=1), keeping MCNT/reserved high bits zero; interrupt mode adds no "
"odd/even-frame commands. Every selected IN direction uses a dedicated Tx "
"FIFO. The entire packet of at most 64 B is loaded synchronously, leaving no "
"software refill work; the TX-empty mask stays zero and no TXFE refill worker "
"is created. Writing IN FIFO is not completion. SUCCESS requires XFRC, cleared"
" EP enable, restored FIFO free capacity and successful "
"observed-W1C-completion clear readback. OUT requires both packet data and "
"XFRC; short packets complete normally. Oversized packets consume every FIFO "
"word, copy at most caller capacity, then report OVERFLOW and drain, never "
"writing outside caller buffers."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:100
msgid ""
"IN TXFE 是只读状态，不参与 W1C 清除/完成的零值证明。ITTXFE 是主机 IN token 在 FIFO 尚空时到达的可重试信息，OUT "
"STUP 是正常 SETUP phase 事实；两者不错误地终止 包。IN control timeout 和 OUT FIFO overrun "
"使用对应方向的真实事件位。EP0 的 DATA PID 由 SETUP/core 管理：bits 29:28/16 对 EP0 是 "
"reserved，软件只对非零 bulk／interrupt endpoint 使用 DATA0 命令。reset／clear-halt 必须核对 "
"DATA0 读回；失败保留 reset admission 屏障或 halt，不提前允许新包借用。"
msgstr ""
"IN TXFE is read-only and contributes neither W1C clearing nor zero-value "
"completion proof. ITTXFE means a retryable host IN token arrived while FIFO "
"was empty; OUT STUP is normal SETUP phase. Neither incorrectly terminates "
"packets. IN control timeout and OUT FIFO overrun use real direction-specific "
"event bits. SETUP/core owns EP0 DATA PID: bits 29:28/16 are reserved on EP0, "
"so software uses DATA0 commands only on nonzero bulk/interrupt endpoints. "
"Reset/clear-halt must check DATA0 readback; failure retains the reset "
"admission barrier or halt instead of admitting a new packet loan early."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:107
msgid ""
"SETUP 严格解码八个 little-endian bytes，并产生单调递增 epoch。新 SETUP/reset 使旧 control loan "
"进入排空，不能仅改 epoch 就撤销借用。reset 与 queued SETUP 在同一 snapshot 中没有先后证明，先前 queued "
"SETUP 被丢弃；reset 在旧 loan 排空和 FIFO flush 后， 还须显式屏蔽并清除选定非零方向的 active，读回成功才清 "
"`reset_pending`。 失败保留 reset 屏障和 clock，由 service 或完整 stop 继续恢复。新 admission 仍须 "
"满足 endpoint 的实际启用条件。SET_ADDRESS 验证 当前标准 SETUP 的各字段，先 staged，只有对应 status-IN 实际"
" XFRC 后写 DCFG 地址。地址读回失败关闭 controller。"
msgstr ""
"SETUP strictly decodes eight little-endian bytes and produces a monotonically"
" increasing epoch. A new SETUP/reset drains the old control loan; changing "
"the epoch alone cannot revoke borrowing. Reset and queued SETUP in the same "
"snapshot have no proven ordering, so earlier queued SETUP is discarded. After"
" draining old loans and flushing FIFOs, reset must also explicitly mask and "
"deactivate selected nonzero directions. Only successful readback clears "
"`reset_pending`. Failure retains the reset barrier and clock, with recovery "
"continuing through service or complete stop. New admission must still meet "
"actual endpoint enable conditions. SET_ADDRESS validates every field of the "
"current standard SETUP and stages the address; it writes the DCFG address "
"only after the corresponding status-IN actually reaches XFRC. Failed address "
"readback closes the controller."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:116
msgid ""
"STM32F407 总线 reset 清除非零 endpoint 的 USBAEP，模型保留这个硬件事实。 生产路径仍在 loan 排空后显式清除非零 "
"active／mask 并核对读回，不仅依赖 reset 事件来证明平台后置条件。完成 reset 后仍需以新当前 epoch 显式 "
"enable；reset／clear-halt／submit 均不自动激活。对 inactive 非零 endpoint， submit 返回 "
"STATE，prepared request 保持 READY，没有新 request／buffer 借用或 FIFO 写入。EP0 control "
"保留既有合同；DATA0 恢复、reset 事件或 controller 未 closing 均不能证明外部 configuration 已提交。"
msgstr ""
"STM32F407 bus reset clears USBAEP on nonzero endpoints; the model retains "
"this hardware fact. After draining loans, the production path still "
"explicitly clears nonzero active/mask state and verifies readback, rather "
"than relying solely on the reset event to prove platform postconditions. "
"After reset completion, enable still requires an explicit new current epoch. "
"Reset/clear-halt/submit never activate automatically. Submitting to an "
"inactive nonzero endpoint returns STATE and leaves the prepared request "
"READY, without a new request/buffer loan or FIFO write. EP0 control retains "
"its existing contract. DATA0 restoration, a reset event or a controller not "
"being closing does not prove that an external configuration committed."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:124
msgid ""
"事件环保存 value facts，满时不覆盖旧事件；精确软件 loss marker 排在原队列后。 最新 SETUP/epoch/closing "
"状态不依赖事件环空间。时间戳是 IRQ acquisition time， 不是 USB 总线采样时刻；reset 批次中的无序旧 SETUP "
"不计作新的已接收 control。"
msgstr ""
"The event ring retains value facts without overwriting old events when full; "
"exact software-loss markers follow existing queue contents. Latest "
"SETUP/epoch/closing state does not depend on ring space. Timestamps are IRQ "
"acquisition times, not USB bus sampling times; unordered old SETUP in reset "
"batches is not counted as newly received control."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:128
msgid "非零 endpoint 显式 activation"
msgstr "Explicit nonzero endpoint activation"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:130
msgid ""
"独立的 `nexus/io/usb_activation.h` 提供 `nx_usb_activation_port_t`：face 是共享 只读 ops"
" 与既有 controller context 两指针，只提供一个同步 `nx_usb_activation_set(port, epoch, "
"endpoint_address, active)` 操作。生成的 "
"`nx_factory_usb_activation(nx_usb_device_id_t)` 返回选定 controller 的静态借用 "
"face，非法或不支持的 identity 返回 NULL；查找不初始化硬件、不 retain clock。 生成独立于 "
"`factory.capabilities`，不要求启用 ROM profile，不改变既有 USB ops、 profile、face 布局或 "
"factory ABI epoch 1。该机制不新增可变 controller／endpoint 状态、队列、worker、实例池、动态分配、TOML "
"字段或 IR 类型。两指针布局说明 face 形状；实际只读保留成本、未引用 GC 与完整镜像成本须分别以对应 ARM ELF 确认。"
msgstr ""
"The separate `nexus/io/usb_activation.h` provides `nx_usb_activation_port_t`:"
" a two-pointer face containing shared read-only ops and the existing "
"controller context, with one synchronous `nx_usb_activation_set(port, epoch, "
"endpoint_address, active)` operation. Generated "
"`nx_factory_usb_activation(nx_usb_device_id_t)` returns a static borrowed "
"face for the selected controller, or NULL for an invalid or unsupported "
"identity. Lookup neither initializes hardware nor retains the clock. "
"Generation is independent of `factory.capabilities`, needs no ROM profile and"
" changes no existing USB ops, profile or face layout, or factory ABI epoch 1."
" The mechanism adds no mutable controller/endpoint state, queue, worker, "
"instance pool, dynamic allocation, TOML field or IR type. The two-pointer "
"layout describes the face shape; retained read-only cost, unreferenced GC and"
" complete-image cost require separate evidence from the corresponding ARM "
"ELF."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:140
msgid ""
"操作只面向已经选定的 EP1–EP3 某一个方向，拒绝两个 EP0 地址及保留／未选地址； OUT 仍只允许既有 bulk。调用者须是同一个序列化特权 "
"Task，进入时 incoming IRQ masks clear。controller 须 started、持有 clock、没有 "
"closing／reset 屏障，参数 `epoch` 等于最新权威软件 control/reset epoch；冷态 epoch 0 合法。无效 "
"identity 或已知旧软件 epoch 在 MMIO 前拒绝。软件检查通过后，已观察到的 raw USBRST 也使本次调用在写入前返回 "
"STATE。尚未采集的物理 SETUP/reset 仍可能随后发生， IRQ 临界区不提供总线原子性；stop/restart 后外部须丢弃旧缓存的 "
"epoch。"
msgstr ""
"The operation addresses one already selected EP1–EP3 direction. Both EP0 "
"addresses and reserved or unselected addresses are rejected; OUT still "
"supports only existing bulk mode. The caller must be the same serialized "
"privileged Task with incoming IRQ masks clear. The controller must be "
"started, retain its clock and have no closing/reset barrier. The `epoch` "
"argument must equal the latest authoritative software control/reset epoch; "
"cold epoch 0 is valid. Invalid identities and already-known stale software "
"epochs reject before MMIO. After software checks pass, an observed raw USBRST"
" also returns STATE before writes. A physical SETUP/reset not yet acquired "
"may still arrive later; the IRQ guard is not a wire-atomic transaction. "
"External callers must discard cached epochs after stop/restart."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:148
msgid ""
"目标方向必须没有 request loan、disable 工作、EPENA、待确认的定义事件或尚未完成的 SETUP 清理。IN 还要求专用 FIFO "
"全空且没有 flush；OUT 要求共享 RX status FIFO 空。 否则返回 BUSY，不暗中取消请求、消费其他方向的 RX "
"或释放其存储。前置检查返回 INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE／BUSY 时没有硬件写入，不建立新 loan；激活本身从不借用 request 或"
" payload，不能代替已有 packet 的 cancel／drain／acquire SETTLED。"
msgstr ""
"The target direction must have no request loan, disable work, EPENA, "
"unacknowledged defined event or unfinished SETUP cleanup. IN also requires "
"its dedicated FIFO fully free and no flush; OUT requires the shared RX status"
" FIFO empty. Otherwise the operation returns BUSY without implicitly "
"cancelling requests, consuming another direction's RX or releasing its "
"storage. INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY preflight rejection performs no hardware "
"writes and creates no new loan. Activation itself never borrows a request or "
"payload and cannot replace an existing packet's cancel/drain/acquire SETTLED."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:154
msgid ""
"冷启动仅使两个 EP0 方向 active 并解除其 endpoint mask；其余选定方向保留 immutable 几何但 "
"inactive／SNAK。使能一个 inactive 方向时，先按选定 MPS、wire 类型和仅 IN 的 FIFO selector 配置目标，建立"
" DATA0、清 STALL、置 active 与 SNAK， 保持 EPENA clear，不写 TSIZ 或 payload "
"FIFO。核对稳定控制字段、DATA0 与 NAK， 仅处理命令后新出现的目标 IN NAK-effective／token-empty "
"提示（0x50），并证明其 W1C 清除；其他新事件使本次操作失败，进入 partial IO／closing。调用前已有的 定义事件仍返回 "
"BUSY，不在前置拒绝中清除。随后解除目标 EP_MASK 位并读回完整 预期 mask。OUT 不写 reserved TxFIFO "
"字段。active、传输使能与 IRQ mask 是三个独立条件；mask 或 active 单独成立均不代表已经接受一个包。"
msgstr ""
"Cold start activates and unmasks only the two EP0 directions. Other selected "
"directions retain immutable geometry but remain inactive/SNAK. Enabling an "
"inactive direction first applies its selected MPS and wire type, and the FIFO"
" selector for IN only, establishes DATA0, clears STALL and sets active/SNAK. "
"It leaves EPENA clear and writes neither TSIZ nor the payload FIFO. It proves"
" stable control fields, DATA0 and NAK, then handles only new target IN NAK-"
"effective/token-empty hints (0x50) arising after the command and proves their"
" W1C clear. Any other new event fails the operation with partial IO/closing. "
"Defined events already present on entry still return BUSY and are not cleared"
" during preflight rejection. It then unmasks the target EP_MASK bit and reads"
" back the complete expected mask. OUT never writes reserved TxFIFO fields. "
"Active state, transfer enable and IRQ masking are independent conditions; a "
"mask or active bit alone does not mean a packet was admitted."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:164
msgid ""
"反激活之前，外部必须实际 cancel／drain 并 acquire 目标 packet 的 SETTLED。 操作先屏蔽目标方向且核对其他 mask "
"位未变，再设置 SNAK、清 active 并核对。 每次仅修改对应方向，保留其他 endpoint 和两个 EP0 位，物理 "
"vector／priority route 不变；不 flush 共享 RX、不重置 controller、不停止 clock，也不开始传输。 Task "
"显式操作在既有有限 poll budget 内等待控制／W1C 读回，每项命令只发一次； reset progress 新增的反激活步骤只单次观察，由后续"
" service 继续，不在 IRQ 引入 此 Task 等待循环。"
msgstr ""
"Before deactivation, the external owner must actually cancel/drain and "
"acquire SETTLED for the target packet. The operation first masks the target "
"direction and proves other mask bits unchanged, then sets SNAK, clears active"
" and reads back the result. Each call changes only its direction, preserving "
"other endpoints and both EP0 bits; physical vector/priority routing stays "
"fixed. It neither flushes shared RX, resets the controller, stops the clock "
"nor starts a transfer. Explicit Task operations wait for control/W1C readback"
" within the existing finite poll budget, issuing each command once. The added"
" reset-progress deactivation step makes one observation and relies on later "
"service to continue; it does not introduce this Task wait loop into IRQ "
"execution."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:172
msgid ""
"幂等调用必须先满足同样的无 loan／无 pending 前置条件。已经 active 的 enable 先核对 immutable "
"几何，不重放控制寄存器配置，只按需修正目标 mask；重复 enable 不得把 DATA1 重置为 DATA0、清除真实 HALT 或发送包。已经 "
"inactive 的 disable 不重新编程几何，只证明目标 mask 关闭及事件清除。只有显式 disable 后重新 enable 才建立新 "
"DATA0 并在读回成功后清 halt；disable 保留 PID。已 active 但 immutable 几何损坏时返回 "
"IO／closing，不通过重写控制寄存器掩盖错误。"
msgstr ""
"Idempotent calls require the same no-loan/no-pending preflight. Enable on an "
"already active direction first validates immutable geometry, does not replay "
"control-register configuration and only repairs the target mask if needed. "
"Repeated enable must not reset DATA1 to DATA0, clear a real HALT or send a "
"packet. Disable on an already inactive direction does not reprogram geometry;"
" it only proves the target mask is off and events are clear. Only explicit "
"disable followed by enable establishes fresh DATA0 and clears halt after "
"successful readback; disable preserves PID. Corrupt immutable geometry on an "
"active direction returns IO/closing without concealing the fault by rewriting"
" control registers."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:179
msgid ""
"控制或 mask 写入后的读回失败返回 IO，并保留既有 `closing` 屏障；IO 可以已有 部分硬件效果，不能作为无操作拒绝。只对目标 best-"
"effort mask／inactive 回滚， 若观察到 EPENA 意外为一，不能假装写零已完成 disable。失败不能通过重试 "
"activation 清 closing；外部须继续推进其他 loan 并执行显式完整 stop。stop 仍可能 BUSY， 在既有 "
"disable／flush／IRQ join 证明完成前保留 clock 与 caller storage。"
msgstr ""
"Failed readback after a control or mask write returns IO and retains the "
"existing `closing` barrier. IO may already have partial hardware effects; it "
"is not a no-operation rejection. Best-effort mask/inactive rollback affects "
"only the target. If EPENA is unexpectedly observed set, writing zero cannot "
"pretend disable has completed. Retrying activation cannot clear closing. The "
"external owner must continue progressing other loans and perform explicit "
"full stop. Stop may still return BUSY, retaining the clock and caller storage"
" until existing disable/flush/IRQ-join proofs complete."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:185
msgid ""
"外部 Chapter 9/configuration owner 根据配置或 alternate 选择方向，先 cancel／ drain／disable"
" 旧方向，再 stage 新方向，随后提交该请求的 STATUS IN。这与 ST 手册及参考 Zephyr 的 before-status "
"顺序一致，不强制解释为 ACK 后才可激活。 外部仅在对应实际 STATUS 完成且仍满足当前事务条件后发布 configured readiness， "
"此前自行阻止普通非零 packet admission。多次 setter 不是配置事务：后续失败、 新 SETUP supersede 或 status"
" 失败时，外部须撤销已经成功的 staging 或显式 stop； 不能用平台 rollback 撤销主机已观察到的 "
"ACK。去配置也须先实际排空／反激活， 再按外部 deadline 与拒绝策略决定是否接受；DCD 不解码 configuration value。"
msgstr ""
"The external Chapter 9/configuration owner chooses directions for the "
"configuration or alternate setting, cancels/drains/disables old directions, "
"stages new directions and then submits STATUS IN for that request. This "
"matches the before-status sequence in the ST manual and reference Zephyr; it "
"does not impose activation only after ACK. The external owner publishes "
"configured readiness only after actual corresponding STATUS completion and "
"while the current transaction conditions still hold, and must gate ordinary "
"nonzero packet admission beforehand. Several setter calls are not a "
"configuration transaction. On a later failure, superseding SETUP or failed "
"status, the owner must undo successful staging or explicitly stop. Platform "
"rollback cannot revoke an ACK already observed by the host. Deconfiguration "
"also requires actual drain/deactivation before the external "
"deadline/rejection policy decides whether to accept; the DCD does not decode "
"configuration values."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:194
msgid ""
"activation 补充既有 FIG-16 的显式控制调用，不新增生命周期 owner 或执行线程。 它不提供 Chapter 9／class "
"stack、CDC notification、多配置／alternate 策略、 连续传输、DMA、ISO、interrupt "
"OUT、HS／Host／OTG 或电气接入；软件机制不证明 物理枚举／reset 时序、完整 IO-35 退出、clean candidate 或 "
"HIL。"
msgstr ""
"Activation adds an explicit control call to existing FIG-16 without a new "
"lifecycle owner or execution thread. It supplies no Chapter 9/class stack, "
"CDC notification, multiple-configuration/alternate policy, continuous "
"transfer, DMA, ISO, interrupt OUT, HS/Host/OTG or electrical integration. "
"Software mechanisms do not prove physical enumeration/reset timing, full "
"IO-35 exit, a clean candidate or HIL."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:199
msgid "可选 EP0 packetizer 与外层借用"
msgstr "Optional EP0 packetizer and outer borrow"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:201
msgid ""
"`nexus/components/usb_control.h` 使用调用者零初始化的 `nx_usb_control_t`，内部 只有两个固定的 "
"packet request 槽；outer `nx_usb_control_request_t` 与 payload "
"也由调用者提供。profile／face 的生命周期覆盖整个绑定的 adapter。应用独占 EP0 packet 使用权；event ring "
"消费、class 分派及 controller 的恢复／停止仍由外部 owner 管理。现有 [FIG-16 I/O "
"装配与执行图](../assets/diagrams/README.md) 的 face→provider 是包层调用；EP0 "
"组件由应用执行者显式推进，不增加生命周期 owner。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus/components/usb_control.h` uses a caller-provided, zero-initialized "
"`nx_usb_control_t` containing only two fixed packet request slots; callers "
"also provide the outer `nx_usb_control_request_t` and payload. The "
"profile/faces must remain valid for the entire lifetime of the bound adapter."
" The application has exclusive use of EP0 packets; external owners still "
"manage event-ring consumption, class dispatch and controller recovery/stop. "
"The face→provider edge in the existing [FIG-16 I/O assembly and execution "
"diagram](../assets/diagrams/README.md) represents packet-layer calls; the "
"application executor explicitly advances the EP0 component, which adds no "
"lifecycle owner."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:208
msgid ""
"prepare 同样仅允许 Task 调用；其余 adapter API 还要求同一个序列化特权 Task 执行，incoming IRQ masks 须"
" clear；不允许第二 Task、ISR 或 callback 重入。 initialize 不启动硬件；prepare 不借用 "
"payload，`nx_usb_control_begin` 按当前 权威 SETUP epoch 准入，成功才建立 outer "
"借用，且本身不提交包。IN 发送 min(length, wLength)，OUT 容量必须覆盖 wLength；请求、控制存储与 payload "
"须满足公共头文件的对齐和不重叠合同。 `nx_usb_control_step` 每次最多调用一次 DCD service、读取一次权威 "
"state，并执行 一次 packet 提交／取消或 STALL 动作。它只检查两个固定 packet 槽，不在一步内循环 完成多包事务，也不创建 "
"worker；调用者在 suspend、cancel 或停机期间仍负责推进。"
msgstr ""
"prepare is also restricted to Task context; all other adapter APIs "
"additionally require execution by the same serialized privileged Task with "
"incoming IRQ masks clear. A second Task, ISR or callback must not reenter. "
"initialize does not start hardware; prepare does not borrow the payload. "
"`nx_usb_control_begin` admits against the current authoritative SETUP epoch, "
"establishes the outer borrow only on success, and does not itself submit a "
"packet. IN sends min(length, wLength); OUT capacity must cover wLength. "
"Requests, control storage and payload must meet the alignment and nonoverlap "
"contracts in the public header. Each `nx_usb_control_step` makes at most one "
"DCD service call, reads authoritative state at most once, and performs at "
"most one packet submission/cancellation or STALL action. It checks only the "
"two fixed packet slots, does not loop through a multipacket transaction "
"within one step, and creates no worker; callers remain responsible for "
"advancing it during suspend, cancel or shutdown."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "事实"
msgstr "Fact"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "允许的结论与后续责任"
msgstr "Permitted conclusion and subsequent responsibility"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "一个 inner packet acquire SETTLED"
msgstr "SETTLED observed with acquire semantics for one inner packet"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "仅该包的 provider 已结束访问；DATA ACK 不完成整个 control 事务，也不返还 outer payload"
msgstr ""
"Only that packet's provider has finished accessing it; DATA ACK neither "
"completes the entire control transaction nor returns the outer payload"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "DATA 全部结束"
msgstr "All DATA has finished"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid ""
"IN 按 MPS 分包，短于 wLength 且恰好落在 MPS 边界时发送必要的 DATA ZLP；OUT 进入 DATA_READY，尚不发送 "
"STATUS IN"
msgstr ""
"IN is split into MPS-sized packets and sends the required DATA ZLP when it is"
" shorter than wLength and ends exactly on an MPS boundary; OUT enters "
"DATA_READY without sending STATUS IN yet"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "对应 STATUS 包真实 ACK"
msgstr "Actual ACK of the corresponding STATUS packet"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "可完成该 outer 事务的线上结果；已 acquire 的 STATUS ACK 先于随后观察到的新 epoch、closing 或超时判定"
msgstr ""
"The on-wire result of that outer transaction may complete; a STATUS ACK "
"already observed with acquire semantics takes precedence over a subsequently "
"observed new epoch, closing state or timeout decision"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid "SET_ADDRESS staging 成功"
msgstr "Successful SET_ADDRESS staging"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:0
msgid ""
"仅暂存地址；STATUS IN 的实际 ACK 与 DCFG 地址写入／读回分别成立，线上成功不保证地址或外部 configuration 已提交"
msgstr ""
"Only the address is staged; actual STATUS IN ACK and the DCFG address "
"write/readback are established separately. On-wire success does not guarantee"
" that the address or external configuration has been committed"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:225
msgid ""
"`nx_usb_control_out_view` 只在同 epoch 的 DATA_READY 且没有 provider packet 引用时， 提供 "
"const 检查视图；outer 借用继续，视图在下一次同 owner adapter 调用时失效， 不能修改、释放或跨 Task "
"传递。外部策略检查内容后调用 `nx_usb_control_approve`： true 才允许下一步 STATUS IN，false 请求对旧事务 "
"STALL。审批包含在原绝对 monotonic deadline 内；已被软件观察到的新 epoch 不接受旧事务的拒绝决定。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_usb_control_out_view` provides a const inspection view only in DATA_READY"
" for the same epoch with no provider packet references. The outer borrow "
"continues; the view expires at the next adapter call by the same owner and "
"must not be modified, freed or passed across Tasks. External policy inspects "
"the contents and then calls `nx_usb_control_approve`: true permits STATUS IN "
"at the next step, while false requests STALL for the old transaction. "
"Approval must occur within the original absolute monotonic deadline; a "
"rejection decision for an old transaction is not accepted once software has "
"observed a new epoch."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:231
msgid ""
"拒绝路径使用选定 ROM profile 的 `setup_decision`：它是一个 "
"`nx_usb_setup_decision_port_t`，仍由共享只读 ops 与既有实例 context 构成两指针 "
"face。`nx_usb_setup_reject` 在同一 IRQ 临界区内检查预期的已发布软件 SETUP epoch、pending／closing"
" 及两个 EP0 方向没有 active provider packet，再执行 STALL 命令并核对读回；旧 generic USB 方法表和 "
"provider context 不增加字段。旧 epoch 的决定不对已观测的新软件事务产生 STALL 效果。这是已观测软件 epoch "
"的序列化合同，不是 USB 总线的物理原子事务。IRQ 尚未采集的 SETUP、主机重试和真实 wire 时序仍需实板验证；outer request "
"的借用不因拒绝、epoch 更新或临界区退出而撤销。"
msgstr ""
"The rejection path uses the selected ROM profile's `setup_decision`, a by-"
"value `nx_usb_setup_decision_port_t` two-pointer face formed from shared "
"read-only ops and the existing instance context. Within one IRQ critical "
"section, `nx_usb_setup_reject` checks the expected published software SETUP "
"epoch, pending/closing state, and the absence of active provider packets in "
"both EP0 directions; it then issues the STALL command and verifies readback. "
"No fields are added to the existing generic USB method table or provider "
"context. A decision for an old epoch cannot STALL a newly observed software "
"transaction. This is a serialization contract for observed software epochs, "
"not a physical atomic transaction on the USB bus. SETUP packets not yet "
"collected by the IRQ, host retries and actual wire timing still require "
"hardware verification; rejection, epoch changes or leaving the critical "
"section do not revoke the outer request's borrow."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:239
msgid ""
"地址策略显式调用 `nx_usb_device_address`，并在 step 刷新后检查权威 device state； "
"`nx_usb_control_snapshot` 只复制最近一次已获取的 state，不替代刷新，也不返还借用。 设备地址、closing 与外部 "
"configuration readiness 不能从 outer SUCCESS 推断。"
msgstr ""
"Address policy explicitly calls `nx_usb_device_address` and checks "
"authoritative device state after step refreshes it. `nx_usb_control_snapshot`"
" only copies the most recently acquired state; it neither replaces a refresh "
"nor returns the borrow. Device address, closing and external configuration "
"readiness cannot be inferred from outer SUCCESS."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:243
msgid ""
"新 SETUP/reset 的 epoch、cancel、timeout 或 device stop 都不撤销旧借用。adapter 先 "
"acquire/fold 已完成 packet，再观察新 epoch；旧 packet 必须实际排空，才能最终 发布 outer "
"SETTLED。描述符字节、outer request、adapter context、profile 和其 endpoint face "
"在此期间保持有效；一个 outer 结束也不替调用者 join 独立 observer。"
msgstr ""
"A new SETUP/reset epoch, cancel, timeout or device stop never revokes an old "
"borrow. The adapter first acquires/folds completed packets and then observes "
"a new epoch; old packets must actually drain before it can finally publish "
"outer SETTLED. Descriptor bytes, the outer request, adapter context, profile "
"and its endpoint faces must remain valid throughout this interval; completion"
" of one outer request does not join independent observers on the caller's "
"behalf."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:248
msgid ""
"如果 OUT0 packet 进入 QUARANTINED，adapter 暴露 `NEEDS_DEVICE_STOP` 并继续保留 outer "
"借用。只有外部 controller owner 能授权 `nx_usb_device_stop`；adapter 不自动停止共享 "
"controller，不用 reset 或重初始化冒充排空。owner 执行实际完整停止 后仍须继续 step，以 acquire packet "
"终态并结束旧 outer；缺少证明时继续保留存储。"
msgstr ""
"If an OUT0 packet enters QUARANTINED, the adapter exposes `NEEDS_DEVICE_STOP`"
" and retains the outer borrow. Only the external controller owner can "
"authorize `nx_usb_device_stop`; the adapter does not automatically stop a "
"shared controller or substitute reset or reinitialization for drain. After "
"the owner performs an actual full stop, it must continue stepping to acquire "
"the packet's terminal state and finish the old outer request; storage remains"
" retained without the required proof."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:253
msgid "可选 CDC ACM 控制子集"
msgstr "Optional CDC ACM control subset"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:255
msgid ""
"`nexus/components/usb_acm.h` 使用调用者零初始化、自然对齐的 `nx_usb_acm_t`， 其中包含一个既有 EP0 "
"packetizer、一个 outer request 和七个 wire bytes。 调用者显式提供 communication interface "
"number、初始 line coding 和控制意图； 不创建实例池、任务、数据泵、UART 绑定或新的 controller/endpoint "
"face。provider 仍共享只读 ops；未引用 `Nexus::USBACM` 不保留类实例或 archive 代码。 外部 dispatcher"
" 独占安排 EP0 使用，并先处理标准请求和其他 interface/class。 class-specific "
"descriptor、capability 宣告、configuration readiness 和应用授权 继续由外部工程负责；通用 "
"descriptor helper 不验证 ACM 类语义。外部若宣告相关 class "
"capability，必须补足其全部必需的请求／notification 合同，不能仅凭这个 控制子集声称完整 CDC 合规。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus/components/usb_acm.h` uses caller-zero-initialized, naturally aligned "
"`nx_usb_acm_t` storage containing one existing EP0 packetizer, one outer "
"request and seven wire bytes. The caller explicitly supplies the "
"communication interface number, initial line coding and control intent; no "
"instance pool, task, data pump, UART binding or new controller/endpoint face "
"is created. Providers still share readonly ops; without a reference to "
"`Nexus::USBACM`, no class instance or archive code is retained. The external "
"dispatcher exclusively schedules EP0 use and handles standard requests and "
"other interfaces/classes first. Class-specific descriptors, capability "
"declarations, configuration readiness and application authorization remain "
"external responsibilities; the generic descriptor helper does not validate "
"ACM class semantics. An external project advertising a class capability must "
"provide all its required request/notification contracts; this control subset "
"alone does not establish complete CDC compliance."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:266
msgid ""
"仅支持 `SET_LINE_CODING`、`GET_LINE_CODING`、`SET_CONTROL_LINE_STATE` 和 "
"`SEND_BREAK`。`bmRequestType` 必须分别是 OUT `0x21` 或 GET 的 IN `0xa1`， `wIndex` "
"必须完整等于选定 interface number；line coding 的 `wValue` 为零且 `wLength` 恰为 "
"`7`，control-line 与 break 的 `wLength` 为零，control-line 只允许 DTR/RTS "
"两位。未知或字段不符的请求通过已有 software-epoch guarded reject 明确 STALL；如果 guarded reject 返回"
" BUSY/STATE/IO 等错误，不能声称 拒绝已经执行。外部不应将其他合法类请求误派给这个窄子集。"
msgstr ""
"Only `SET_LINE_CODING`, `GET_LINE_CODING`, `SET_CONTROL_LINE_STATE` and "
"`SEND_BREAK` are supported. `bmRequestType` must be OUT `0x21`, or IN `0xa1` "
"for GET. The complete `wIndex` must equal the selected interface number. Line"
" coding requires zero `wValue` and `wLength` of exactly `7`; control-line and"
" break requests require zero `wLength`, and control-line permits only the two"
" DTR/RTS bits. Unknown requests or malformed fields are explicitly stalled "
"through the existing software-epoch guarded rejection. If guarded rejection "
"returns an error such as BUSY/STATE/IO, rejection cannot be reported as "
"completed. External dispatch must not misroute other valid class requests to "
"this narrow subset."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:274
msgid ""
"`SET_LINE_CODING` 先接收七字节暂存到 DATA_READY， `nx_usb_acm_pending` "
"仅复制值供外部检查。线编码的共享格式检查只接受非零 rate、 stop bits `0..2`、parity `0..4` 与 data bits "
"`5/6/7/8/16`；实际 UART 能力与 产品策略可更窄。short DATA 或非法字段不能获批，但仍可显式拒绝。 control-"
"line/break 请求在获批前不准入 STATUS。所有 mutation 都必须由同一 序列化特权 Task 显式 "
"`nx_usb_acm_approve`；true 仅准许后续 STATUS，不提前 修改 committed 状态或应用物理线路。审批包含在原绝对 "
"monotonic deadline 内。"
msgstr ""
"`SET_LINE_CODING` first receives seven staged bytes into DATA_READY; "
"`nx_usb_acm_pending` copies values only for external inspection. Shared line-"
"coding format checks accept only nonzero rate, stop bits `0..2`, parity "
"`0..4` and data bits `5/6/7/8/16`; actual UART capabilities and product "
"policy may be narrower. Short DATA or malformed fields cannot be approved, "
"but may still be explicitly rejected. Control-line/break requests do not "
"admit STATUS before approval. Every mutation requires explicit "
"`nx_usb_acm_approve` from the same serialized privileged Task. True permits "
"subsequent STATUS only; it neither changes committed state nor applies "
"physical lines early. Approval remains within the original absolute monotonic"
" deadline."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:282
msgid ""
"只有对应 outer acquire SUCCESS、即真实 STATUS ACK 后，组件才提交批准的 软件意图并更新 "
"`committed_epoch`。新 SETUP/reset/cancel 按既有 packetizer 规则排空，不撤销借用；未获得 outer "
"SUCCESS 的终态不提交。cancel 成功只请求 排空：若撤回 endpoint 前，对应 STATUS 仍获真实 ACK，outer "
"acquire SUCCESS 仍提交已批准的原 epoch 意图。已经 acquire 的 STATUS ACK 不被后来的 "
"SETUP/reset、closing 或 state 读取失败撤销，紧接的 GET 返回已提交的新 line coding。reset 后是否恢复 "
"初始类状态是外部 owner 的独立策略。每次 `nx_usb_acm_step` 最多推进一次既有 packetizer，保持每步最多一次 "
"service、一次 state 读取及一次 packet 动作； 外部仍须在取消、超时、suspend 和停机期间继续推进并保留所有 storage。 "
"OUT0 quarantine 仍须外部 controller owner 授权真实完整停止，组件不自动 stop。"
msgstr ""
"Only after the matching outer acquire SUCCESS, meaning a real STATUS ACK, "
"does the component commit approved software intent and update "
"`committed_epoch`. New SETUP/reset/cancel drains under the existing "
"packetizer rules without revoking borrows; a terminal outcome without outer "
"SUCCESS does not commit. Successful cancellation only requests drain: if the "
"matching STATUS still receives a real ACK before endpoint withdrawal, outer "
"acquire SUCCESS still commits the approved original epoch intent. An already "
"acquired STATUS ACK is not revoked by later SETUP/reset, closing or a failed "
"state read; an immediately following GET returns the newly committed line "
"coding. Whether reset restores initial class state is separate external owner"
" policy. Each `nx_usb_acm_step` advances the existing packetizer at most "
"once, preserving the per-step bounds of one service, one state read and one "
"packet action. The external executor must continue progress and retain all "
"storage during cancellation, timeout, suspend and shutdown. OUT0 quarantine "
"still requires the external controller owner to authorize real complete stop;"
" the component does not stop it automatically."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:293
msgid ""
"外部在每次 step 后、派发下一请求前读取 snapshot，按新的 `committed_epoch` 应用 UART 参数、DTR/RTS 或 "
"break，并独立处理应用失败与恢复；snapshot 不是事件队列， 软件提交不证明外设已应用。`SEND_BREAK` 仅记录 "
"`0`（停止）、`0xffff`（无限期）或 有限毫秒意图，不建计时器、不自动清除，也不证明物理 break。控制子集不提供 bulk "
"数据搬运、serial-state notification、完整 CDC 枚举、其他类或物理资格。"
msgstr ""
"After each step and before dispatching the next request, the external owner "
"reads the snapshot and uses a new `committed_epoch` to apply UART parameters,"
" DTR/RTS or break, with separate responsibility for application failures and "
"recovery. The snapshot is not an event queue, and software commit does not "
"prove peripheral application. `SEND_BREAK` records only `0` (stop), `0xffff` "
"(indefinite) or a finite millisecond intent; it creates no timer, performs no"
" automatic clearing and does not prove physical break. The control subset "
"provides no bulk data movement, serial-state notification, complete CDC "
"enumeration, other classes or physical qualification."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:299
msgid "取消、失败与完整停止"
msgstr "Cancellation, failure and complete stop"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:301
msgid ""
"任务入口要求单一序列化特权执行者、Handler 外与 incoming IRQ masks clear。IRQ 保存/恢复 mask；一次最多消费八个 "
"RX status、128 payload words 和八个选中方向。 冷热路径分开：cold reset/flush 有有限 poll "
"budget；IRQ flush 只发一次命令并读回， 从不在 IRQ 使用 cold poll loop。超时使用独立 monotonic "
"deadline，USB suspend 或 拔线后仍须由外部执行者调用 service，不依赖 SOF 或隐藏 timer。"
msgstr ""
"Task entries require one serialized privileged executor outside Handler mode "
"with clear incoming IRQ masks. IRQs save/restore masks, consume at most eight"
" RX status items, 128 payload words and eight selected directions per call. "
"Cold/hot paths are separate: cold reset/flush has finite poll budgets; IRQ "
"flush issues one command and readback, never cold polling in IRQ. Timeout "
"uses independent monotonic deadlines; USB suspend/unplug still needs external"
" executor service, not SOF or hidden timers."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:307
msgid ""
"IN drain 先请求 SNAK、读到实际 NAK 状态，再请求 disable；EN clear、EPDISD、FIFO flush 和 W1C "
"clear 必须全部成立。OUT 非零方向先确认 global OUT NAK，再 disable 及排空 RX。drain 超时保留 "
"QUARANTINED，不能撤销 buffer loan。"
msgstr ""
"IN drain requests SNAK, observes actual NAK, then requests disable. EN clear,"
" EPDISD, FIFO flush and W1C clear must all hold. Nonzero OUT first confirms "
"global OUT NAK, then disables and drains RX. Drain timeout retains "
"QUARANTINED and never revokes buffer loans."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:311
msgid ""
"Control OUT0 的 EPD 位固定为零，SETUP 也可绕过 NAK。不能模拟一个不存在的 disable ack 来完成取消。OUT0 "
"individual cancel 在缺少真实完成证明时保持 DRAINING，随后 QUARANTINED；用户可选择完整 device "
"stop。完整停止先读回 soft disconnect、global OUT NAK 与 DMAEN=0，消费 RX FIFO；随后关闭 "
"global/endpoint/NVIC sources 并 join 所有通知发布者，flush FIFO，再次验证 "
"disconnect/NAK/FIFO/IRQ 状态，才解除 OUT0 PIO loan、最后发布 SETTLED。OUT0 EP enable "
"此时可以仍为一，因为硬件只拥有内部 FIFO，已撤回的 PIO 执行者不再拥有 caller buffer；下一次 cold core reset 重新 "
"建立硬件状态。任一步证据缺失就返回 BUSY，并保留 caller storage 与 clock consumer。"
msgstr ""
"Control OUT0 EPD is permanently zero and SETUP may bypass NAK. Cancellation "
"cannot be completed by modeling a nonexistent disable acknowledgement. "
"Without actual completion proof, individual OUT0 cancellation remains "
"DRAINING then QUARANTINED; users may select full device stop. Full stop reads"
" back soft disconnect, global OUT NAK and DMAEN=0, consumes RX FIFO, disables"
" global/endpoint/NVIC sources and joins all notification publishers, flushes "
"FIFO, then rechecks disconnect/NAK/FIFO/IRQ state before releasing OUT0 PIO "
"loans and finally publishing SETTLED. OUT0 EP enable may still be one because"
" hardware owns only internal FIFO and withdrawn PIO executors no longer own "
"caller buffers; next cold core reset reestablishes hardware state. Missing "
"proof at any step returns BUSY with caller storage and clock consumer "
"retained."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:320
msgid ""
"捕获 wake target 后 publisher count 仍保留该借用；stop/detach 在 notify 未返回时 拒绝 "
"BUSY。wake 必须同时支持 service/cancel 的 task 上下文和真正 IRQ 上下文， 绑定读取实际 priority/group "
"验证 syscall ceiling，不修改全局 grouping。"
msgstr ""
"After wake-target capture, publisher counts still retain that borrow; "
"stop/detach returns BUSY until notify returns. Wake must support both "
"service/cancel task context and true IRQ context. Binding reads actual "
"priority/grouping to validate syscall ceilings without changing global "
"grouping."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:324
msgid "实现位置与验收边界"
msgstr "Implementation locations and acceptance boundaries"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:326
msgid ""
"F4 绑定在 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/usb_device.c`；PIO 控制器机制在 "
"`soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/fs_device_pio/`。厂商寄存器布局与位定义来自锁定的 "
"`vendors/st/cmsis_device_f4/`，芯片资料身份由该家族的 `references.json` 固定。 Native 外部 "
"MMIO 模型位于 `tests/support/native/drivers/usb_device*`，只在测试 配置中启用，不作为生产 "
"SoC。公共组件与 F4 绑定分别由 `tests/google/usb_*` 测试和精确 ARM "
"装配验证；用例数与资源结论以当前提交的真实执行报告为准。"
msgstr ""
"The F4 binding resides in `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/usb_device.c`; the PIO "
"controller mechanism resides in "
"`soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/fs_device_pio/`. Vendor register layouts and "
"bit definitions come from locked `vendors/st/cmsis_device_f4/`, while the "
"family's `references.json` fixes chip-document identities. Native external "
"MMIO models reside in `tests/support/native/drivers/usb_device*` and are "
"enabled only in test configurations, never as a production SoC. Public "
"components and F4 bindings are verified separately by `tests/google/usb_*` "
"tests and exact ARM assemblies. Case counts and resource conclusions come "
"from actual execution reports for the current commit."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:333
msgid ""
"历史跨系列开发报告只描述其记录的固定源码、配置和工具身份，不代表本轮保留的 平台范围，也不覆盖后续 profile、descriptor、EP0 或 "
"activation 修改。原始报告 保持原字节；旧计数不能作为当前候选的完成证明。当前提交仍须分别通过公共合同、 F4 寄存器模型、ARM "
"链接、资源预算、SDK consumer 与完整本地门禁。"
msgstr ""
"Historical cross-series development reports describe only their recorded "
"fixed source, configuration and tool identities. They neither define this "
"iteration's retained platform scope nor cover subsequent profile, descriptor,"
" EP0 or activation changes. Original reports retain their original bytes; old"
" counts cannot prove completion of the current candidate. The current commit "
"must independently pass public contracts, F4 register models, ARM links, "
"resource budgets, SDK consumers and complete local gates."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:338
msgid ""
"当前精确芯片范围为 F407VE／ZG，板卡范围是启明 V3.1、ZG 核心板、V4.1 和 天空星青春版；这不表示四板均已取得每项 USB "
"电气资格。板级必须逐项确认 USB role、VBUS sensing/power/backfeed、pull-up/ESD、跳帽及共享引脚约束。 "
"软件装配可以选择 PA11／PA12，pin claim 不证明实际接线或角色正确。"
msgstr ""
"Current exact chip scope is F407VE/ZG. Board scope comprises Qiming V3.1, ZG "
"core board, V4.1 and Sky youth edition; this does not mean all four boards "
"have obtained every USB electrical qualification. Board review must check USB"
" role, VBUS sensing/power/backfeed, pull-up/ESD, jumpers and shared-pin "
"constraints individually. Software assembly may select PA11/PA12, but a pin "
"claim proves neither actual wiring nor the correct role."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:343
msgid ""
"有限 interrupt IN、显式 activation 和 EP0 组件仍不提供完整 Chapter 9／class stack 或外部配置事务。完整"
" IO-35 退出资格、物理枚举、主机重试、reset／拔线、 PHY flush 时序、IRQ／WCET 与 HIL "
"必须另行验收；本环境没有连接实板，均未执行。"
msgstr ""
"Finite interrupt IN, explicit activation and EP0 components still supply no "
"complete Chapter 9/class stack or external configuration transaction. "
"Complete IO-35 exit qualification, physical enumeration, host retries, "
"reset/disconnection, PHY flush timing, IRQ/WCET and HIL require separate "
"acceptance. This environment has no connected board; none has been executed."
